OL,3,GNEWSABid to turn meadow into village
OL,4,Agreen refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to turn a meadow into a village
OL,7,Fgreen has been refused by a county
OL,8,Fcouncil because it has already been
OL,9,Fdesignated as a Local Nature Reserve
OL,10,F(LNR).
OL,12,FSinglers Marsh in Welwyn,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, is a 15-acre meadow by
OL,14,Fthe River Mimram which is regularly
OL,15,Fused by dog walkers and families.
OL,17,FApplications to have the site
OL,18,Fregistered as a village green were
OL,19,Flodged in 2020 and in 2022, with more
OL,20,Fthan 1,000 local people backing the
OL,21,Fapplication.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
