OL,3,GNEWSABid to turn meadow into village
OL,4,Agreen refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a meeting of the Hertfordshire
OL,7,FCounty Council's Development Control
OL,8,FCommittee on 21 October, councillors
OL,9,Frefused to grant the application.
